+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+This project has no recorded decision on a cache eviction policy. A search of the repository's documentation (README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, CHANGELOG.md, docs/doc.md, BENCHMARKS.md) and source comments found no ADR, policy document, or other recorded decision specifying an eviction strategy (e.g., LRU, LFU, TTL) for any cache in the project; the only cache-related references found are unrelated implementation details (such as per-request query/form parameter caching in `Context` and an example use of `autocert.DirCache` for TLS certificates), none of which constitute a recorded eviction policy.
